          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in the round throughout. Chain 26. Join into a ring. Work rounds of alternating fpdc and bpdc. After 10 cm, form the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "thumb-opening-g114"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "thumb opening"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": skip 5 sts, chain 5 in their place, continue rib. On the next round work 5 dc into the chain-5 space and resume rib. Continue for a further 10 cm. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "One size: 26 sts in the round, 20 cm total height. Make 2."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
